            "description": {
              "value": "Your training has prepared you to recognize most undead on sight. You become trained in two Lore skills, each about a specific type of undead, or become an expert if you were already trained. You gain the Slayer's Identification free action.\n\n**Slayer's Identification**\nActivate (Free Action)\nTrigger: You roll initiative and can observe a creature you know is undead\nYou attempt to Recall Knowledge to identify the undead creature with a +1 circumstance bonus. If you're a master in the skill you're using to Recall Knowledge, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus instead."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
